---
description: Design-system library rules (libs/ui is consumed by apps/web)
globs:
  - "libs/ui/**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

`libs/ui` is the Zard/shadcn design-system library used by `apps/web`. Add components with the Zard CLI; never add application or domain logic here.

The boundary rules that apply to it live in `apps/web/docs/architecture-boundaries.md` ("Nx Project Boundaries" and the `type:ui-kit` tag).
